cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software in your research, please cite it using the
  metadata below. Where a DOI has been assigned, cite the version DOI so
  that readers obtain exactly the code that was used.
title: "siRNA Design Studio"
abstract: >-
  A pipeline for the design and evaluation of small interfering RNA in which
  the methodological assumptions are made explicit and inspectable. It
  implements host-specific rule profiles for plant, mammalian and insect
  targets; off-target analysis with positional weighting of mismatches and
  correction for the number of chance matches expected in a database of a
  given size; alignment-free assessment of conservation across pathogen
  isolates with the coverage threshold determined from the data; sensitivity
  analysis of the scoring weights together with Pareto-front identification;
  and generation of laboratory-ready oligonucleotide forms including C911
  specificity controls, in vitro transcription templates and detection
  primers. Results are accompanied by a reproducibility report recording the
  input checksum, every parameter used and the limitations of the analysis.
